(7670129, 1251571, 173844, '<td valign="top">Through some beautiful transpositions seems to open out on the universe.  Never a lacking door through which to pass.  From flowers to butterflies to galaxies, a joyous voyage.<br/>Personal favorite of the challege.</td>', 'Through some beautiful transpositions seems to open out on the universe.  Never a lacking door through which to pass.  From flowers to butterflies to galaxies, a joyous voyage.Personal favorite of the challege.', '2020-07-17 23:19:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670130, 1251850, 173844, '<td valign="top">Buoyant and thrilling.  The toning is lovely, like sheerest tissue paper.  The sky with its clouds looks like marble.  Every bird a treat.  Is this what you see when you close your eyes?</td>', 'Buoyant and thrilling.  The toning is lovely, like sheerest tissue paper.  The sky with its clouds looks like marble.  Every bird a treat.  Is this what you see when you close your eyes?', '2020-07-17 23:26:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670131, 1251572, 173844, '<td valign="top">Not only the wheat heads but also the every which way bristles.  They''re the shining pathways of nature, neurons and synapses, endlessly playful.  Every shade of gold.<br/></td>', 'Not only the wheat heads but also the every which way bristles.  They''re the shining pathways of nature, neurons and synapses, endlessly playful.  Every shade of gold.', '2020-07-17 23:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670132, 1251867, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely light to pick out the stems and seeds, so much like a crosshatch ink drawing.  Also I see a face, with green right eye and aquiline nose.</td>', 'Lovely light to pick out the stems and seeds, so much like a crosshatch ink drawing.  Also I see a face, with green right eye and aquiline nose.', '2020-07-17 23:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670133, 1251313, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love the flowers, both sharp and blurred.  I am finding it tough to integrate the way the sharp left and right bracket the dreamy center, but it is interesting and holds my attention.  Maybe it should be approached like candy, a strawberry truffle.</td>', 'I love the flowers, both sharp and blurred.  I am finding it tough to integrate the way the sharp left and right bracket the dreamy center, but it is interesting and holds my attention.  Maybe it should be approached like candy, a strawberry truffle.', '2020-07-18 00:03:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670134, 1251787, 173844, '<td valign="top">Most interesting take on a cemetary.  The visual remove seems to lessen the sadness to appreciate and let the visual beauty emerge.  It looks like the openings on the roll of a player piano.  When the saints go marching in.</td>', 'Most interesting take on a cemetary.  The visual remove seems to lessen the sadness to appreciate and let the visual beauty emerge.  It looks like the openings on the roll of a player piano.  When the saints go marching in.', '2020-07-18 00:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670135, 1251869, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely glowing image.  Can you graph beauty, can it be digitized and pummeled into formulae?  Here''s a resounding "No!"  So reassuring.  A goldfinch isn''t datum, but a singular blessing.</td>', 'Lovely glowing image.  Can you graph beauty, can it be digitized and pummeled into formulae?  Here''s a resounding "No!"  So reassuring.  A goldfinch isn''t datum, but a singular blessing.', '2020-07-18 00:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670136, 1251864, 173844, '<td valign="top">Bokeh, beauty''s afterimage.  The fading notes of the last dance.  Here''s a captivating reprise of dawn.</td>', 'Bokeh, beauty''s afterimage.  The fading notes of the last dance.  Here''s a captivating reprise of dawn.', '2020-07-18 00:19:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670137, 1251409, 173844, '<td valign="top">An overwhelming mandala, hard to pull one''s eyes away.</td>', 'An overwhelming mandala, hard to pull one''s eyes away.', '2020-07-18 00:21:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670165, 1251865, 173844, '<td valign="top">Rich pink, yellow and yellow-green, a recipe for exuberance.  Sometimes one feels, "Get out of my face!"  Here, just the opposite.</td>', 'Rich pink, yellow and yellow-green, a recipe for exuberance.  Sometimes one feels, "Get out of my face!"  Here, just the opposite.', '2020-07-18 10:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670166, 1251390, 173844, '<td valign="top">Few in number, overwhelming in gorgeous.</td>', 'Few in number, overwhelming in gorgeous.', '2020-07-18 10:59:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670168, 1251598, 173844, '<td valign="top">Many fine flower photos, this is the least forced, a kind of beauty in itself.  Come across this field, stop, see, breathe deeply.</td>', 'Many fine flower photos, this is the least forced, a kind of beauty in itself.  Come across this field, stop, see, breathe deeply.', '2020-07-18 11:04:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670169, 1251635, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely mass of entreaties, as these plants always seem to be reaching out.  Can''t follow it further, which is frustating.  Wonderful greens.</td>', 'Lovely mass of entreaties, as these plants always seem to be reaching out.  Can''t follow it further, which is frustating.  Wonderful greens.', '2020-07-18 11:08:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670170, 1251854, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this, like bars of clouds, or the shadows of venetians blinds.  In itself and in the "on and on" of being.</td>', 'I like this, like bars of clouds, or the shadows of venetians blinds.  In itself and in the "on and on" of being.', '2020-07-18 11:12:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670171, 1251824, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  How did you corral the universe into such an interesting composition?  Arizona?  Favorite detail: the reflection of the meteor in the water.</td>', 'Beautiful.  How did you corral the universe into such an interesting composition?  Arizona?  Favorite detail: the reflection of the meteor in the water.', '2020-07-18 11:20:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670172, 1251843, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the blur here, with some focused details pushing through.  Lovely colors and composition.  A flurry of hummingbirds.</td>', 'I like the blur here, with some focused details pushing through.  Lovely colors and composition.  A flurry of hummingbirds.', '2020-07-18 11:24:28.000000', NULL, 0),
